팁: 12/7 10시 도착해 짐 먼저 맡기기
https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Hyatt%20Regency%20Paris%20Etoile%20Paris</description><styleUrl>#hotel</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>2.284,48.88,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>파리 동역 짐 보관소</name><description>Gare de l'Est luggage storage · 북역·동역
